            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='41833' id='12' type-v2='text' w='49517' x='483' y='57227'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>CLEANING DECISIONS </run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Duplicates:</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> 40 exact duplicate rows (differ only in record_id and source_note) removed with a data source filter: 6,856 -&gt; 6,816 rows. </run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Missing values:</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> 35 blank values (0.5%) left blank, not estimated. 55 blank income labels set to &quot;Not recorded&quot;. </run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Text:</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> TRIM + PROPER on country, continent, income and priority labels (see table on the right). </run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>KPIs:</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> filtered by indicator code; AVG for life expectancy and GDP per capita, SUM for population (one year only). </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> LIMITATIONS</run>
              <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Data ends in 2007 · 5-year snapshots · training extract with added issues · North and South Korea share ISO code &quot;KOR&quot; on the map · priority bands are derived labels, not official UN categories.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
